<section class="page-hero"><span class="pub-kicker">See StockChief in action</span><h1>Take a closer look<br>at the real operation.</h1><p>A short tour of the real StockChief app, filmed in a demonstration business.</p></section><section class="truth-recording"><video controls playsinline preload="metadata" width="1920" height="1200" poster="/demo/<%= demo.poster %>?v=<%= locals.assetVersion||'current' %>" aria-label="StockChief product video, no sound"><source src="/demo/<%= demo.video %>?v=<%= locals.assetVersion||'current' %>" type='video/mp4; codecs="avc1.640032"'><% if(demo.webm){ %><source src="/demo/<%= demo.webm %>?v=<%= locals.assetVersion||'current' %>" type='video/webm; codecs="vp9"'><% } %>Your browser can download the <a href="/demo/<%= demo.video %>">product video</a>.</video><p>Filmed in <%= demo.business %>. <%= demo.speed %></p></section><section class="truth-demo-chapters"><% for(const scene of demo.screens){ %><article data-reveal><figure><img loading="lazy" src="/demo/<%= scene.file %>?v=<%= locals.assetVersion||'current' %>" alt="StockChief screen: <%= scene.title %>" width="1440" height="900"></figure><h2><%= scene.title %></h2><button type="button" data-video-chapter="<%= Math.floor(scene.atMilliseconds/1000) %>">Watch this chapter</button><p><%= scene.text %></p></article><% } %></section><section class="qualification-note"><h2>What this video shows</h2><p>A real browser using the current StockChief app, in a demonstration business with sample products, customers and orders. The answer and the report were produced by StockChief’s AI from those records while filming; only the waiting is sped up. Payments, carriers and mailboxes were not connected for this recording.</p></section><section class="truth-final"><p class="pub-kicker">Bring your own operation</p><h2>See the fit.<br>Choose your plan.</h2><div class="pub-actions"><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing">Compare plans</a><a class="pub-btn pub-btn--secondary" href="/capabilities">Explore capabilities</a></div></section>
